## ⚙️ How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.
3. Make sure the required project folders and CSV dataset are available.
4. Open `index.html` using a web browser or Live Server.
5. Navigate through the website and explore the interactive dashboard.

